(7761062, 1285515, 88235, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a ten just because I love star trails and this must have taken a couple of hours of waiting.<br/> <br/>Some constructive criticism though. When you do star trails, the foreground is more important than the star trails themselves. While the trails are a very cool phenomenon, essentially they are just streaks of light. This capture would have been more interesting if we could see what is going on in the rocks.</td>', 'I''m giving you a ten just because I love star trails and this must have taken a couple of hours of waiting. Some constructive criticism though. When you do star trails, the foreground is more important than the star trails themselves. While the trails are a very cool phenomenon, essentially they are just streaks of light. This capture would have been more interesting if we could see what is going on in the rocks.', '2023-12-15 08:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
